## Product

- **Webastral** — Admin-only for now (freelancer/client login later)
- Hierarchy: **Admin → Client → Website(s) → connections / snapshots / reports**
- Four sources: Google Ads, Meta Ads, GA4, Search Console (per website)
- **Meta app:** v1 = reports only (`ads_read`). Same Business app later grows to full ads ops (`ads_management`). Do **not** tick every Meta use case now. Add products/scopes when that UI ships.
- Platform apps once in `.env`; tokens per website on `connections`
- **Google access revoked:** confirm with Google API first → banner + Remove client / Reconnect — `docs/01-core/04-integrations/STANDARD_GOOGLE_ACCESS_REVOKED.md`
- Admin can Connect agency Google and **Import as client** from GA4/GSC list (bulk import shipped)

## Stack

- Next `web/` :3000 + Express `src/` :4000; `npm run dev` via concurrently
- SQLite `node:sqlite`; no Prisma

## Implementation

- Thin `/api`; Settings = platform env health only
- Never mark Connected without probe; never leak tokens

## Git

- Remote developer1607/seo-tool; no commit/push unless asked
- Do not commit `.env`, `Engineering.md`, design-mocks, `db/app.sqlite`

